         MACRO
&NAME    CLOSE &LIST
         LCLA  &I,&OPT
&NAME    CNOP  0,4
         BRAS  1,RDC&SYSNDX
.NEXT    ANOP
&I       SETA  &I+1
&OPT     SETA  0
         AIF   (&I+1 LT N'&LIST).ENTRY
&OPT     SETA  128
.ENTRY   DC    AL1(&OPT),AL3(&LIST(&I))
&I       SETA  &I+1
         AIF   (&I LT N'&LIST).NEXT
RDC&SYSNDX DS  0H
         SVC   20
         MEND
